OL,3,GNEWSACouncil to pay mum and son #10k
OL,4,Afor 'lost' education
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council will will pay a mother #1,000
OL,7,Fand her son #9,000 for causing them
OL,8,F"significant frustration" and
OL,9,Fdisrupting the young person's
OL,10,Feducation.
OL,12,FThe Local Government and Social Care
OL,13,FOmbudsman upheld a complaint from a
OL,14,Fwoman after Slough Borough Council
OL,15,Ffailed to secure the special education
OL,16,Fprovision required in her son's
OL,17,FEducation, Health and Care (EHC) plan.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,332,330,200,160,0,100
