OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACouncil to pay mum and son #10k
OL,4,Afor 'lost' education
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council did not complete her son's
OL,7,FEHC plan review every 12 months and did
OL,8,Fnot secure all of the special
OL,9,Feducational provision included in his
OL,10,Fplan, the ombudsman found.
OL,12,FA council spokesperson told the Local
OL,13,FDemocracy Reporting Service the local
OL,14,Fauthority is "sincerely sorry for the
OL,15,Ffrustration, uncertainty and distress"
OL,16,Fcaused.
